  << /ActualText (I am writing to express my interest in the Graphic \046 Media Designer position\056 With over 20 years of experience as a Brand \046 Product Designer\054 I specialize in creating clean\054 scalable visual systems that balance high\055end aesthetics with functional user experiences\056)
