889 0 obj
  << /ActualText (While I am not a daily user of your workouts\054 I have long respected Fitness Blender\031s transparent\054 no\055gimmicks ethos and how you maintain a highly structured\054 user\055friendly content platform\056 My background includes design execution for medical marketing\054 dermatology\054 and medical aesthetics clients\054 which has given me a sharp eye for the exact visual codes your audience values\072 cleanliness\054 absolute clarity\054 and high\055trust layouts\056)
     /K [ 9 ]
     /P 890 0 R
